{{znaczenia}}
''czasownik''<ref name="LSJ">[https://atlas.perseus.tufts.edu/dictionaries/entry/urn%3Acite2%3Ascaife-viewer%3Adictionaries.v1%3Alsj-n22210/ Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Henry Stuart Jones, ''A Greek-English Lexicon'', hasło „γιγνώσκω”, Scaife ATLAS]</ref>
