: (1.1) ''[[οὐ]] [[μέντοι]] [[τοσοῦτος|τοσοῦτός]] [[γε]] '''[[λοιμός|λοιμὸς]]''' [[οὐδέ|οὐδὲ]] [[φθορά|φθορὰ]] [[οὕτως]] [[ἄνθρωπος|ἀνθρώπων]] [[οὐδαμοῦ]] [[μνημονεύω|ἐμνημονεύετο]] [[γίγνομαι|γενέσθαι]].'' → [[nie|Nie]] [[pamiętać|pamiętano]] [[jednak]], [[by]] [[gdziekolwiek]] [[wystąpić|wystąpiła]] [[tak]] [[wielki|wielka]] '''[[zaraza]]''' [[ani]] [[tak]] [[wielki|wielka]] [[zagłada]] [[człowiek|ludzi]].<ref>[https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A2.47.3/ Tukidydes, ''Historiae'' 2,47,3, Scaife Viewer, Perseus Digital Library]</ref>
: (1.1) ''[[σεισμός|σεισμοί]] [[τε]] [[μέγας|μεγάλοι]] [[καί|καὶ]] [[κατά|κατὰ]] [[τόπος|τόπους]] [[λιμός|λιμοὶ]] [[καί|καὶ]] '''[[λοιμός|λοιμοὶ]]''' [[εἰμί|ἔσονται]].'' → [[być|Będą]] [[też]] [[wielki|wielkie]] [[trzęsienie|trzęsienia]] [[ziemia|ziemi]] [[i]] [[w]] [[różny|różnych]] [[miejsce|miejscach]] [[głód|głody]] [[i]] '''[[zaraza|zarazy]]'''.<ref>[https://www.studybible.info/SBLGNT/Luke%2021%3A11 Michael W. Holmes (red.), ''The Greek New Testament: SBL Edition'', Łk 21,11, Society of Biblical Literature 2010]</ref>
: (1.2) ''[[ὁ]] [[φαρμακός]], [[ὁ]] '''[[λοιμός]]'''.'' → [[ten|Ten]] [[truciciel]], [[ten]] '''[[szkodnik]]'''.<ref>[https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0014.tlg025.perseus-grc2%3A80/ ''Contra Aristogitonem I'' 25,80, ''Corpus Demosthenicum'', Scaife Viewer, Perseus Digital Library]</ref>
