''zaimek osobowy, trzecia osoba; forma enklityczna''<ref name="MiddleLiddell">[https://atlas.perseus.tufts.edu/dictionaries/entry/urn%3Acite2%3Ascaife-viewer%3Adictionary-entries.atlas_v1%3Amiddle-liddell.perseus-eng2-n21304/ Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, ''An Intermediate Greek-English Lexicon'', hasło „μιν”, Scaife ATLAS].</ref><ref name="Smyth325D">[https://grammars.alpheios.net/smyth/xhtml/body.1_div1.2_div2.6.html Herbert Weir Smyth, ''A Greek Grammar for Colleges'', § 325 D, Alpheios].</ref>
