{{odmiana}}
: (1.1-2) [[deklinacja|III deklinacja]], temat ''προσταγματ-''<ref name="LSJ"/><ref name="Goodell">[https://dcc.dickinson.edu/grammar/goodell/neuter-stems-%CF%84 Thomas Dwight Goodell, ''A School Grammar of Attic Greek'', § 119, „Neuter Stems in -τ”, Dickinson College Commentaries.]</ref>
