: (1.1) '''[[τώ|τὼ]]''' [[δέ|δʼ]] [[αὐτός|αὐτὼ]] [[μάρτυς|μάρτυροι]] [[εἰμί|ἔστων]] → [[niech]] [[zaś]] '''[[obaj]]''' [[sam|sami]] [[być|będą]] [[świadek|świadkami]]<ref>[https://atlas.perseus.tufts.edu/nodes/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0012.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A1.338/ Homer, ''Iliada'' 1,338, Scaife ATLAS]</ref>
: (1.1) [[ὡς|ὣς]] '''[[τώ]]''' [[γε]] [[κλαίω|κλαίοντε]] [[προσαυδάω|προσαυδήτην]] [[φίλος|φίλον]] [[υἱός|υἱὸν]] → [[tak]] [[właśnie]] '''[[oboje]]''', [[płakać|płacząc]], [[przemawiać|przemawiali]] [[do]] [[drogi|drogiego]] [[syn|syna]]<ref>[https://atlas.perseus.tufts.edu/nodes/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0012.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A22.90/ Homer, ''Iliada'' 22,90, Scaife ATLAS]</ref>
: (2.1) '''[[τώ]]''' [[σύ|σε]] [[χρή|χρὴ]] [[περί]] [[μέν|μὲν]] [[φημί|φᾶσθαι]] [[ἔπος]], [[ἠδέ|ἠδʼ]] [[ἐπακούω|ἐπακοῦσαι]] → '''[[dlatego]]''' [[ty|tobie]] [[należeć|należy]] [[przede]] [[wszystko|wszystkim]] [[wypowiedzieć]] [[słowo]] [[i]] [[również]] [[wysłuchać]]<ref>[https://www.homermultitext.org/staging/va-facsimile/msA.113v/ Homer, ''Iliada'' 9,100, rękopis Venetus A, Homer Multitext]</ref>
: (2.1) '''[[τώ]]''' [[κε]] [[κορέννυμι|κορεσσάμεθα]] [[κλαίω|κλαίοντέ]] [[τε]] [[μύρομαι|μυρομένω]] [[τε]] → '''[[w]] [[taki|takim]] [[raz|razie]]''' [[móc|moglibyśmy]] [[do]] [[syta]] [[płakać]] [[i]] [[lamentować]]<ref>[https://atlas.perseus.tufts.edu/nodes/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0012.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A22.427/ Homer, ''Iliada'' 22,427, Scaife ATLAS]</ref>
: (2.1) '''[[τώ|τὼ]]''' [[νῦν]] [[μή]] [[ἐγώ|μοι]] [[μᾶλλον]] [[ἐν]] [[ἄλγος|ἄλγεσι]] [[θυμός|θυμὸν]] [[ὀρίνω|ὀρίνῃς]] → '''[[dlatego]]''' [[teraz]] [[nie]] [[wzburzać|wzburzaj]] [[ja|mi]] [[bardziej]] [[serce|serca]] [[wśród]] [[cierpienie|cierpień]]<ref>[https://dcc.dickinson.edu/homer-iliad/homer-iliad-xxiv-552-595 Homer, ''Iliada'' 24,568, tekst grecki i komentarz, Dickinson College Commentaries]</ref>
