== ἐς ({{język starogrecki}}) ==
{{transliteracja}}
: es
{{wymowa}}
{{znaczenia}}
''przyimek''
: (1.1) z {{B}}; o kierunku lub celu ruchu: [[do]], [[w]], [[na]], [[ku]]<ref name="Smyth1686">[https://grammars.alpheios.net/smyth/xhtml/body.1_div1.4_div2.19.html Herbert Weir Smyth, ''A Greek Grammar for Colleges'', § 1686, Alpheios]</ref><ref name="Monro222">[https://dcc.dickinson.edu/grammar/monro/%CE%B5%E1%BC%B0%CF%82 D.B. Monro, ''A Grammar of the Homeric Dialect'', § 222, Dickinson College Commentaries]</ref><ref name="Cunliffe">[https://atlas.perseus.tufts.edu/dictionaries/entry/urn%3Acite2%3Ascaife-viewer%3Adictionaries.v1%3Acunliffe_lex-n2780/ Richard John Cunliffe, ''A Lexicon of the Homeric Dialect'', hasło „εἰς, ἐς”, Scaife ATLAS]</ref>
: (1.2) z {{B}}; w określeniach czasu, wskazując granicę, termin lub przewidywany okres: [[do]], [[aż do]], [[na]], [[w]]<ref name="Smyth1686"/><ref name="Monro222"/><ref name="Cunliffe"/>
: (1.3) z {{B}}; przy określeniach liczby, ilości lub miary: [[do]], [[około]]<ref name="Smyth1686"/>
: (1.4) z {{B}}; o celu, przeznaczeniu lub zamierzonym rezultacie: [[do]], [[na]], [[dla]], [[w celu]]<ref name="Smyth1686"/><ref name="Cunliffe"/>
{{odmiana}}
{{przykłady}}
: (1.1) ''[[πέμπω|πέμψω]] [[δέ|δʼ]] [[ἐς]] [[Σπάρτη|Σπάρτην]] [[τε]] [[καί|καὶ]] [[ἐς]] [[Πύλος|Πύλον]] [[ἠμαθόεις|ἠμαθόεντα]]'' → [[wysłać|wyślę]] [[zaś]] '''[[do]]''' [[Sparta|Sparty]] [[i]] '''[[do]]''' [[piaszczysty|piaszczystego]] [[Pylos]]<ref>[https://atlas.perseus.tufts.edu/nodes/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0012.tlg002.perseus-grc2%3A1.93/ Homer, ''Ὀδύσσεια'' 1,93, Scaife ATLAS]</ref>
: (1.1) ''[[ἐς]] [[Σικελία|Σικελίαν]] [[ἔρχομαι|ἐλθεῖν]]'' → [[przybyć]] '''[[do]]''' [[Sycylia|Sycylii]]<ref>[https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A6.2.5/ Tukidydes, ''Ἱστορίαι'' 6,2,5, Scaife Viewer]</ref>
: (1.1) ''[[ἐς]] [[Κυρήνη|Κυρήνην]] [[σῴζω|ἐσώθησαν]]'' → [[ocalić|ocaleli]], [[dotrzeć|docierając]] '''[[do]]''' [[Cyrena|Cyreny]]<ref>[https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A1.110.1/?right=perseus-grc2 Tukidydes, ''Ἱστορίαι'' 1,110,1, Scaife Viewer]</ref>
: (1.2) ''[[ὡς|ὣς]] [[τότε]] [[μέν|μὲν]] [[πρόπας|πρόπαν]] [[ἦμαρ]] [[ἐς]] [[ἠέλιος|ἠέλιον]] [[καταδύω|καταδύντα]]'' → [[tak]] [[wtedy]] [[przez]] [[cały]] [[dzień]] '''[[aż]] [[do]]''' [[zachód|zachodu]] [[słońce|słońca]]<ref>[https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0012.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A1.601/ Homer, ''Ἰλιάς'' 1,601, Scaife Viewer]</ref>
: (1.2) ''[[ἐπιμένω|ἐπιμεῖναι]] [[ἐς]] [[αὔριον]]'' → [[pozostać]] '''[[aż]] [[do]]''' [[jutro|jutra]]<ref>[https://atlas.perseus.tufts.edu/nodes/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0012.tlg002.perseus-grc2%3A11.351/ Homer, ''Ὀδύσσεια'' 11,351, Scaife ATLAS]</ref>
: (1.2) ''[[καί|καὶ]] [[φημί|φάτʼ]] [[ἔρχομαι|ἐλεύσεσθαι]] [[ἤ|ἢ]] [[ἐς]] [[θέρος]] [[ἤ|ἢ]] [[ἐς]] [[ὀπώρα|ὀπώρην]]'' → [[i]] [[mówić|mówił]], [[że]] [[przyjść|przyjdzie]] [[albo]] '''[[latem]]''', [[albo]] '''[[jesienią]]'''<ref>[https://www.greek-language.gr/digitalResources/ancient_greek/library/browse.html?page=106&text_id=133 Homer, ''Ὀδύσσεια'' 14,384, Κέντρο Ελληνικής Γλώσσας]</ref>
: (1.3) ''[[ἐς]] [[τετρακόσιοι|τετρακοσίους]]'' → '''[[około]]''' [[czterysta|czterystu]]<ref>[https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A3.107.3/ Tukidydes, ''Ἱστορίαι'' 3,107,3, Scaife Viewer]</ref>
: (1.3) ''[[ἐς]] [[πεντακόσιοι|πεντακοσίους]] [[καί|καὶ]] [[χίλιοι|χιλίους]]'' → '''[[około]]''' [[tysiąc]] [[pięćset]]<ref>[https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A5.6/ Tukidydes, ''Ἱστορίαι'' 5,6, Scaife Viewer]</ref>
: (1.3) ''[[ἐς]] [[ὀκτακόσιοι|ὀκτακοσίους]]'' → '''[[około]]''' [[osiemset|ośmiuset]]<ref>[https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A7.32/?right=perseus-grc2 Tukidydes, ''Ἱστορίαι'' 7,32, Scaife Viewer]</ref>
: (1.4) ''[[ἐς]] [[πόλεμος|πόλεμον]] [[ἅμα]] [[λαός|λαῷ]] [[θωρήσσω|θωρηχθῆναι]]'' → [[uzbroić]] [[się]] '''[[do]]''' [[walka|walki]] [[razem]] [[z]] [[wojsko|wojskiem]]<ref>[https://atlas.perseus.tufts.edu/nodes/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0012.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A1.226/ Homer, ''Ἰλιάς'' 1,226, Scaife ATLAS]</ref>
: (1.4) ''[[παρασκευάζω|παρασκευάζεσθαι]] [[τε]] [[ἐς]] [[ὁ|τὸν]] [[πόλεμος|πόλεμον]]'' → [[przygotowywać]] [[się]] '''[[do]]''' [[wojna|wojny]]<ref>[https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0003.tlg001.perseus-grc2%3A2.13.2/ Tukidydes, ''Ἱστορίαι'' 2,13,2, Scaife Viewer]</ref>
: (1.4) ''[[ἐς]] [[ἀπόδειξις|ἀπόδειξιν]] [[ὁ|τοῦ]] [[περίειμι|περιέσεσθαι]] [[ὁ|τῷ]] [[πόλεμος|πολέμῳ]]'' → '''[[dla]]''' [[wykazanie|wykazania]], [[że]] [[zwyciężyć|zwycięży]] [[w]] [[wojna|wojnie]]<ref>[https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn%3Acts%3AgreekLit%3Atlg0003.tlg001/perseus-grc2%3A2.13.9/ Tukidydes, ''Ἱστορίαι'' 2,13,9, Scaife Viewer]</ref>
