''spójnik''
: (2.1) [[że]]<ref name="LSJ"/><ref name="Goodell">[https://dcc.dickinson.edu/grammar/goodell/%E1%BD%85%CF%84%CE%B9-%CE%B4%CE%B9%CF%8C%CF%84%CE%B9-and-%CE%BF%E1%BD%95%CE%BD%CE%B5%CE%BA%CE%B1-clauses Thomas Dwight Goodell, ''A School Grammar of Attic Greek'', §§ 622–626, Dickinson College Commentaries]</ref>
: (2.2) [[ponieważ]], [[bo]], [[gdyż]], [[skoro]]<ref name="LSJ"/><ref name="Goodell"/>
